{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"尼日利亚","country_iso":"NGA","created_at":"2026-03-23T10:50:57.343681","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"NGA-HB-0016","ldc":"No","location":"科吉州","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"尼日利亚科吉州土石方项目","project_name_en":"Nigeria Kogi State Earthwork Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"中交国际","content":"近日，中国交建尼日利亚公司接连收到科吉州土石方项目、东南部输变电项目及三角洲炼化厂项目三个项目的中标函。\n科吉州土石方项目顺利中标为我公司后续进入当地建筑市场，参与业主其他项目实施创下良好开局；东南部输变电项目是尼日利亚公司中标的首个电力项目，对持续深耕当地电力领域、参与民生项目实施具有重要意义；三角洲炼化厂项目EPC总承包合同已同步签署，在尼日利亚取消燃油补贴的大环境下，亟需大力发展当地石油化工等能源领域项目，项目的签约意味着我公司成功进入能源领域市场，为后续能源类项目经营奠定坚实基础。\n尼日利亚公司积极响应中国交建及国际分公司“大抓现汇、抓大现汇”以及“大力拓展新兴业态”的经营导向，成功推动上述三个项目落地，对公司在尼日利亚市场多领域拓展具有重要意义。","content_sha256":"a1fb0235ad934998c0d04374eff8a4a193f962207a9dcfb3b0efed368840b50d","id":13037,"publish_date":"2023-06-23 09:30:19","title":"中国交建在尼日利亚连中三元","title_sha256":"18e7dad58aeaf9aff7b643df1aed91176fdd1241a7511d9d5e660a77a153ec85","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/42008.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"NGA-HB-0016","capacity_details":"","capacity_mw":null,"capacity_mw_raw":"","capacity_source":null,"contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:50:57.344582","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"NGA-HB-0016-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"http://www.cnr.cn/bj/ygjz/20200608/t20200608_525121021.shtml\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"","project_developer_en":null,"project_stage":"中标","project_summary":"中国交建尼日利亚公司中标了科吉州土石方项目，为公司进入当地建筑市场奠定了基础，但该项目与能源无关。","publish_date":"2023-06-23 09:30:19","pv_capac